, suggests an Iron Age provenance [1]. It is believed that the structure was reoccupied during the Norman Conquest [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92384", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92385", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245549", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:245550", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s001: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304592", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/00d711e5/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/00d711e5/Belsar''s Hill, earthwork and ditch (geograph 3394865).webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:305802", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/00d711e5/Belsar''s Hill, earthwork and ditch (geograph 3394865).webp\" -> ''/data/images/wiki/00d711e5/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306678", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/00d711e5/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/00d711e5/Belsar''s Hill, earthwork and ditch (geograph 3394865).webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384925", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384926", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
