ign of Ptolemy III Euergetes and completed in 57 BC under Ptolemy XII Auletes [1]. It was built on the site of an earlier, smaller temple also dedicated to Horus, although the previous structure was oriented east–west rather than north–south as in the present site [1]. A naos of Nectanebo II, a relic from an earlier building, is preserved in the inner sanctuary, which stands alone while the temple\\''s barque sanctuary is surrounded by nine chapels [1]. The temple of Edfu is the largest temple dedicated to Horus and Hathor of Dendera [1]. It was the center of several festivals sacred to Horus [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:141992", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-001: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/Temple_Edfou_Egypte.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Edfu-Relief2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304643", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Edfu-Relief2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Temple_Edfou_Egypte.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:305853", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Temple_Edfou_Egypte.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Edfu-Relief2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306729", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Edfu-Relief2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0312b756/Temple_Edfou_Egypte.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
