 graffiti, inadvertently destroying the prehistoric artwork in the process [1] [2]. The incident earned them the 1992 Ig Nobel Prize in Archaeology [1] [3].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302092", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302093", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346246", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346247", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-10000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399523", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399524", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}]'::jsonb),
