 traditionally was referred to as a castle and Castle Road which runs alongside the site was named after it [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92500", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:92501", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s001: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302094", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302095", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
