 two of the roof-bearing post holes and some of the wall posts belonging to a longhouse dated to the Late Iron Age or Viking Age [1]. A series of flint finds were found that showed evidence of flintknapping that can be dated to the Funnelbeaker culture of the Neolithic period [1]. Ceramic shards found in one of the pithouses can be dated to the Germanic Iron age [1]. Endebjerg is important to the study of Viking activity on Samsø because of the evidence of trade found in the excavations [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93265", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93266", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142759", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0be2f25c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0be2f25c/Post_hole_A12.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246031", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246032", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346302", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346303", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399545", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399546", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}]'::jsonb