 {"source": "remediation_change_log:399547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399548", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('0e12027e-9a65-470f-aca7-2cb1eb408120'::uuid, 'mystery', '4', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:0e12027e-9a65-470f-aca7-2cb1eb408120:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''5'' restored on Temple of Athena, Paestum', '782bf190af39f9bfc5d7e4067e4f4c7a', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 4 from (''Temple complex'', ''500 BC - 1 AD'') is shared by 53 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:28698", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0181:chunk-0001: period_start ''-1500'' -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:30344", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-22_mechanical-period-name: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:81818", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2044:chunk-0001: description ''The Temple of Athena is a Greek temple of Magna Graecia located at Paestum in the province of Salerno, Campania, southwestern Italy [1]. Built around 500 BC, it was originally incorrectly thought to have been dedicated to Ceres [1]. However, the recovery of numerous terracotta statuettes depicting Athena confirmed its dedication to the Greek goddess Athena [1].'' -> ''The Temple of Athena is a Greek temple of Magna Graecia found at Paestum, in Capaccio Paestum [1]. It was built around 500 BC and was for some time incorrectly thought to have been dedicated to Ceres, but as a result of the recovery of numerous statuettes in terracotta depicting Athena, it is now thought to have been dedicated to her [1]. Built on an artificial relief of the ground, it has a high pediment on the façade and a Doric frieze, adorned with metopes encased in sandstone [1]. The interior of the wide pronaos contained six columns in the Ionic style, of which the bases and two capitals remain [1]. These capitals burst from an ornate collar [1]. This seems to be the first example of two architectural orders, Doric and Ionic, co-existing in a single building [1]. Almost nothing remains of the deep cella destined to house the statue of the goddess [1]. In late antiquity, around the eighth century, the structure was used as a church: the sanctuary was closed with walls between the columns, the walls of the cella were torn down [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:142856", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-002: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/Paestum_BW_2013-05-17_13-58-28.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Detail of the west facade - Temple of Athena - Paestum - Italy 2015.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304822", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Detail of the west facade - Temple of Athena - Paestum - Italy 2015.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Paestum_BW_2013-05-17_13-58-28.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306023", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-001-001-rollback-rest-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Paestum_BW_2013-05-17_13-58-28.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Detail of the west facade - Temple of Athena - Paestum - Italy 2015.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:306908", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Detail of the west facade - Temple of Athena - Paestum - Italy 2015.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/0e12027e/Paestum_BW_2013-05-17_13-58-28.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
