re that extended over about 10 square kilometres [1]. This extended urban area is known as the Cotzumalhuapa Nuclear Zone by archaeologists and Bilbao lies in the southernmost part of this area [1]. Bilbao was occupied since the Preclassic and was the most important site dating to the Preclassic within what became in later periods the Cotzumalhuapa Nuclear Zone [1]. 58 monuments were listed by Parsons at Bilbao, but only 3 remain in situ in Bilbao''s Monument Plaza [1]. Ballgame reliefs at Bilbao feature blossoming and fruiting plants symbolic of agricultural fertility [1]. Stelae at Bilbao depict ballplayers with disembodied heads and various sculptures depict dismembered body parts [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93366", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93367", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93368", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:234603", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s001: site_type None -> ''Urban''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246079", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246080", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346334", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346335", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355572", "url": "remediation_change_