75 hectares [1]. The rampart, of earth and stone, is up to 15 metres wide and 0.8 metres above the interior [1]. In the north, the slope is less steep than elsewhere, and there is a second rampart outside this [1]. There are two original entrances: an inturned entrance in the south-west, and an entrance at the north end of the east defences [1]. Results of excavations in 1966 and 1975 have been interpreted as showing an early period of occupation, followed by a long interval of disuse (suggested by ditches containing silt and parts of collapsed rampart), and later a hurried reconstruction of the defences [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93396", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:93397", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246089", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246090", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384976", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384977", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399555", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399556", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
