ge defensive site which saw re-use in the Dark Age period, perhaps as a coastal trading station [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114813", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114814", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114815", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114816", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_Peak,_Devon'' -> ''https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=43929''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144044", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1da76491/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1da76491/View from Peak Hill, near Sidmouth - geograph.org.uk - 1372146.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246517", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:307809", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/1da76491/View from Peak Hill, near Sidmouth - geograph.org.uk - 1372146.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/1da76491/2010-10-07_peak_hill_sidmouth.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347167", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347168", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-800'' 