IDPAPZ project scientific team and supervised by the archaeologists Jose Carlos Sastre Blanco and Oscar Rodriguez Monterrubio [1]. Archaeological finds place this site in an intermediate period between the 1st and the 2nd Iron Age about the 7th century BC [1]. It covers an area of around 2 hectares and settlement is distributed on tells [1]. Excavations and surveys on the site have made possible the identification of several enclosures covering the north slope of the hill where the settlement was constructed [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114835", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: lat ''42.0835084488162'' -> ''42.064137''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114836", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: lon ''-6.53330111679788'' -> ''-6.526643''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114837", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114838", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144601", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/GRABADOS.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2069e069/Muralla_de_Peñas_de_la_Cerca.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235582", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235583", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-700''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308455", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/2069e069/Muralla_de_Peñas_de_la_Cerca.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2069e069/GRABADOS.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
