e Twentieth Legion [1] [2] [3]. Above ground, the four-storey building incorporates a section of the distinctive Chester Rows at first-floor level [1] [4].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324969", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/21ac323f/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/21ac323f/Roman remains in 39 Bridge Street, Chester (3).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
