 Abbotsbury Castle as they did at some other hill forts [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95255", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95256", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144683", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/23cb48d4/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/23cb48d4/Abbotsbury Castle interior.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246887", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246888", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/23cb48d4/Abbotsbury Castle interior.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/23cb48d4/Dorset_abbotsbury_castle_earthworks.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385035", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385036", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399605", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399606", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
