ely 1,000 tombs from the 4th and 5th centuries BC were discovered [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95265", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95266", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-1500'' -> ''-2700''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144688", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/24018f0c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/24018f0c/Kerameikos Cemetery from Melidone Street on June 19, 2020.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308527", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/24018f0c/Kerameikos Cemetery from Melidone Street on June 19, 2020.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/24018f0c/Kerameikos_Cemetery_on_July_28,_2019.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('241df2d5-69c9-47e0-9df3-105a26a4d141'::uuid, 'mystery', '6', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:241df2d5-69c9-47e0-9df3-105a26a4d141:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''4'' restored on Carl Wark', '3fb64a8fe593950b392cf80b38e4cbd6', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 6 from (''Fort'', ''Undated'') is shared by 25 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82312", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2058:chunk-0001: description \"Carl Wark is an Iron Age hillfort on Hathersage Moor in the Peak District, just inside Sheffield''s boundary in South Yorkshire[1]. The rocky promontory is defended by vertical cliffs on three sides, with a prehistoric embankment protecting the fourth side[1]. The date of construction and purpose of the fortifications remain unknown, though it is typically assigned to the Iron Age period[1]. The site is a scheduled monument and lies near Higger Tor[1][2].\" -> \"Carl Wark (sometimes Carl''s Wark) is a rocky promontory on Hathersage Moor in the Peak District National Park, just inside the boundary of Sheffield, England [1]. The promontory is faced by vertical cliffs on all but one side, which is protected by a prehistoric embankment [1]. The cliffs and embankment form an enclosure that has been interpreted as an Iron Age hill fort, though the date of construction and purpose of the fortifications remains unknown [1]. Carl Wark is located at grid reference SK259814, at an elevation of about 370 metres above sea level [1]. The promontory is approximately 230 metres long and 60 metres wide, oriented south-east to north-west [1]. The southern edge of the enclosure consists of large earth-fast boulders that have been reinforced with millstone grit blocks, forming a wall 2–2.5 metres high [1]. A rampart across the western end of the promontory completes the enclosure [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114847", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114848", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114849", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:144689", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/241df2d5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/241df2d5/Carl Wark Fort.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246895", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246896", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308530", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/241df2d5/Carl Wark Fort.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/241df2d5/Carl_Wark_rampart_face_20090912.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385037", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385038", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
