e for occupation within it [1]. In the late 1st century, a Romano-British farmhouse was built within the abandoned prehistoric enclosure [1]. Excavations were carried out at Alfred''s Castle from 1998 to 2000 by archaeologists from Oxford University [1]. A final analysis was published in 2014 [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:145394", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/285feaf7/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/285feaf7/Alfred''s Castle - panoramio.webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321241", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/285feaf7/Alfred''s Castle - panoramio.webp\" -> ''/data/images/wiki/285feaf7/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324981", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/285feaf7/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/285feaf7/Alfred''s Castle, Oxfordshire, aerial view from North.webp\""}]'::jsonb),
    ('2882893b-da7b-4afa-bd4a-e8d4ffb76dcd'::uuid, 'mystery', '7', '8', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:2882893b-da7b-4afa-bd4a-e8d4ffb76dcd:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''8'' restored on Roman Villa of Freiria', 'b4ec4464f925b1faff8000c8f24f6bf4', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 7 from (''Residence/villa/farmhouse'', ''1500 - 500 BC'') is shared by 6 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82454", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2062:chunk-0001: description ''A wealthy Roman villa in Sao Domingos de Rana, Cascais, occupied from the Iron Age through the 5th century AD. Excavated between 1985 and 2002, the site revealed a peristyle domus with polychrome mosaics, private thermae with three temperature zones, a monumental granary comparable only to Monroy in Spain, and an olive mill. Discoveries include an altar dedicated to the deity Triborunis, glass vessels, and a solar quadrant. A necropolis southeast of the villa contained both cremation and inhumation burials. One of the most important Roman villa finds on the Iberian Peninsula.'' -> ''The Roman villa of Freiria is a Roman villa in the civil parish of São Domingos de Rana [1]. The site of Freiria and its surrounding areas have long been inhabited due to access to water [1]. A Palaeolithic site was identified 300 metres to the north of the villa and evidence of a Chalcolithic settlement was found 200 metres to the northeast [1]. Evidence suggests that the Freiria area was occupied at the end of the 1st Iron Age and continued to be occupied when the end of the 2nd Iron Age briefly co-existed with Roman occupation [1]. The site is situated in a rural area surrounded by agricultural lands [1]. The surrounding agricultural area includes rural structures such as a barn and winery [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:145397", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-006: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/VillaFreiria.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2882893b/Villa Romana de Freiria. 11-19 (02).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235654", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235655", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-700''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321249", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/2882893b/Villa Romana de Freiria. 11-19 (02).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2882893b/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324982", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/2882893b/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2882893b/VillaFreiria.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
