ch in the County Borough of Rhondda Cynon Taf [1]. The summit is smoothly rounded and provides rough grazing for sheep [1]. A wind farm and an Iron Age Celtic hillfort are located on the summit [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35717", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: period_start ''-800'' -> ''-1500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114937", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114938", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mynydd_Maendy'' -> ''https://coflein.gov.uk/en/sites/301331''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146230", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Mynydd_Maendy_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1312878.jpg/400px-Mynydd_Maendy_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1312878.jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236531", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: lat ''51.57011333778682'' -> ''51.6486''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236532", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: lon ''-3.4699892739394214'' -> ''-3.5086''"}]'::jsonb),
