val mound measuring 73 metres from north to south and 66 metres from east to west [1]. It is constructed of earth and small stones to a height of from 3.6 to 5.5 metres [1]. Flakes of flint have been found on the mound''s summit [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96392", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96393", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146264", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/Roundloafcairn.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/2fe636b2/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347295", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347296", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399641", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399642", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
