 in Wiltshire [1]. It lies at a height of 254m AOD [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96470", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96471", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146354", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/337268d6/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/337268d6/68 of ''A Parochial History of St. Mary Bourne, with an account of the Manor of Hurstbourne Priors, Hants'' (11195871684).webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247393", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247394", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309427", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/337268d6/68 of ''A Parochial History of St. Mary Bourne, with an account of the Manor of Hurstbourne Priors, Hants'' (11195871684).webp\" -> ''/data/images/wiki/337268d6/Fosbury - geograph.org.uk - 692531.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385089", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385090", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399653", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399654", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fi