s brutally punished [1]. The Commentaries on the Gallic War describe Uxellodunum as being strongly fortified by its natural position, with a river dividing the valley below that almost surrounded the steep craggy mountain on which the citadel was built [1]. In the 19th century there was controversy as to the location of Uxellodunum [1]. Archaeological work has since validated the theory that the oppidum in question was at Puy d''Issolud [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116158", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116159", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116160", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146413", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url \"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Plan_d''Uxellodunum_(Puy_d''Issolu)_-1.jpg/400px-Plan_d''Uxellodunum_(Puy_d''Issolu)_-1.jpg\" -> ''/data/images/wiki/3651b680/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247417", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247418", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385099", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385100", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399657", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-per