t Ihor Gereta [1]. During the excavations, 315 burials were discovered, including 288 Chernyakhov, 24 Kievan Rus'', two Pomeranian, and one unidentified burial, probably dating from the Bronze Age [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97276", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97277", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147141", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3c1e886f/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3c1e886f/Моя_Тернопільщина_Місто407.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247805", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247806", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348105", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348106", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
