    ('416634af-9655-4973-a39a-9e1a9e3f0f2c'::uuid, 'mystery', '6', '7', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:416634af-9655-4973-a39a-9e1a9e3f0f2c:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''7'' restored on Menhir of Patalou', '688c26af2228653edc0c880ecfe9b14b', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 6 from (''Megalithic stones'', ''< 4500 BC'') is shared by 12 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:34363", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0026:chunk-0001: description ''The Menhir of Patalou is a megalithic standing stone located in the Nisa municipality, Portalegre District of Portugal, approximately 5 km from the town of Nisa [1]. Dating to the 5th millennium BCE, it is believed to be the second oldest example of a menhir identified in Western Europe [1].'' -> ''The Menhir of Patalou is located in the Nisa municipality in the Portalegre District of Portugal, about 5 km from the town of Nisa [1]. The menhir is a megalithic standing stone dating back to the 5th millennium BCE [1]. It is believed to be the second oldest example of a menhir to be identified in Western Europe [1]. The Menhir of Patalou is situated on a gentle east-facing slope, framed by two small hills [1]. Having fallen over in the Chalcolithic era, it was re-erected in 2015, six meters north of its original location [1]. The stone was carved out of granite and has phallic features [1]. Its total height is 4 meters and the maximum diameter is 1.07 meters [1]. The menhir was found in the late 1990s by a hunter, João Francisco Lopes, when he was hunting in the Tapada da Bajanca [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147848", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-009: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/416634af/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/416634af/Menir do Patalou kz01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:321442", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/416634af/Menir do Patalou kz01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/416634af/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325012", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/416634af/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/416634af/MenhirdoPatalou2.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
