rt; this was probably of practical importance in the fort''s location [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98113", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98114", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148623", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Pentre_Camp_Hill_Fort,_Llangyniew_(geograph_2963273).jpg/400px-Pentre_Camp_Hill_Fort,_Llangyniew_(geograph_2963273).jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248249", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248250", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385737", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385738", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400309", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400310", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
