emble a giant eel [1]. The stones vary in size from about 30 centimetres to 150 centimetres, with some possibly having been embedded in holes in the ground so as to make them stand upright [1]. The Lake Bolac ceremonial site, and the similar Wurdi Youang site, were identified as being Aboriginal structures on the basis that there was \"no counterpart among colonial structures and there was no evidence that they ever formed part of any type of fence or building\" [1]. At some stage, some of the stones were removed to make way for a road [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98119", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98120", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248253", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248254", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348197", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348198", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('49d6b7c5-e692-4e51-845f-304cad53f3af'::uuid, 'mystery', '3', '2', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:49d6b7c5-e692-4e51-845f-304cad53f3af:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''2'' restored on Alabanda', '5c7b7aee73ab23b1da8012b2017c24ea', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 3 from (''City/town/settlement'', ''Undated'') is shared by 120 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:83538", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2083:chunk-0001: description ''Alabanda (or Antiochia of the Chrysaorians) was an ancient Carian city in Anatolia, located near modern Doğanyurt, Çine, in Aydın Province, Turkey [1]. The site features notable remains including a theatre with massive carved pillars from the Hellenistic period [2]. While excavations have uncovered architectural fragments, very few inscriptions have been found at the site [3]. The city was situated in the historical region of Caria, which lay between ancient Lycia and Ionia, reflecting the cultural blending typical of southwestern Anatolia.'' -> ''Alabanda or Antiochia of the Chrysaorians was a city of ancient Caria, Anatolia, the site of which is near Doğanyurt, Çine, Aydın Province [1]. The name reverted to Alabanda after the Seleucid defeat at the Battle of Magnesia in 190 BC [1]. The ruins of Alabanda are 8 km west of Çine and consist of the remains of a theatre and several other buildings, but excavations have yielded very few inscriptions [1]. The names of some bishops of Alabanda are known because they participated in church councils [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98123", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98124", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148674", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/The_Theater_of_Alabanda_(49222297773).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237548", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:310393", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/The_Theater_of_Alabanda_(49222297773).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/Alabanda_Bouleuterion.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348201", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348202", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-400'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
