ed in church councils [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98123", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98124", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148674", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/The_Theater_of_Alabanda_(49222297773).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237548", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:310393", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/The_Theater_of_Alabanda_(49222297773).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/Alabanda_Bouleuterion.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348201", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348202", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-400'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
    ('4a07cc38-1b55-4254-b0ad-fe875310caf7'::uuid, 'mystery', '4', '5', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:4a07cc38-1b55-4254-b0ad-fe875310caf7:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''5'' restored on Temple of Augustus, Pula', '052296960dab04a7445e70c68f873cc0', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 4 from (''Temple complex'', ''500 BC - 1 AD'') is shared by 53 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:83540", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2083:chunk-0001: description \"The Temple of Augustus is a well-preserved Roman temple in Pula, Croatia, dedicated to the first Roman emperor Augustus[1]. It was constructed between 27 BC and AD 14 during the emperor''s lifetime[1]. The temple stands on a podium featuring a tetrastyle prostyle porch with Corinthian columns, measuring approximately 8 by 17.3 metres and reaching 14 metres in height[1]. Its richly decorated frieze closely resembles that of the Maison Carrée in Nîmes, France, a slightly larger and more recent structure[1]. Together, these two temples are considered the finest complete Roman monuments surviving outside Italy[1].\" -> \"The Temple of Augustus is a well-preserved Roman temple in the city of Pula, Croatia [1]. Dedicated to the first Roman emperor, Augustus, it was probably built during the emperor''s lifetime at some point between 27 BC and his death in AD 14 [1]. It was built on a podium with a tetrastyle prostyle porch of Corinthian columns and measures about 8 by 17.3 m, and 14 m high [1]. The richly decorated frieze is similar to that of a somewhat larger and more recent temple, the Maison Carrée in Nîmes [1]. The temple was part of a triad consisting of three temples [1]. The Temple of Augustus stood at the left side of the central temple, and the similar temple of the goddess Diana stood on the other side of the main temple [1]. Under Byzantine rule, the temple was converted into a church, accounting for its survival to modern times, and was later used as a granary [1]. The temple''s dedication originally consisted of bronze letters affixed by nails to the stones of the architrave [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148683", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/Templo_de_Augusto%2C_Pula%2C_Croacia%2C_2017-04-17%2C_DD_71-73_HDR.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4a07cc38/Kroatien_Pula_Augustustempel.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:310396", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/4a07cc38/Kroatien_Pula_Augustustempel.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4a07cc38/Templo_de_Augusto,_Pula,_Croacia,_2017-04-17,_DD_71-73_HDR.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
