rt of the Rydno Archaeological Reserve, a complex spanning from Skarżysko-Kamienna to Wąchock, containing several hundred former Paleolithic sites. Archaeological evidence from the area includes stone tools and other artifacts from the Stone Age period.'' -> ''Marcinków is a village in Gmina Wąchock, Starachowice County, Świętokrzyskie Voivodeship, south-central Poland [1]. The village was the location of several Paleolithic industrial sites [1] [2]. These sites are part of the Rydno Archaeological Reserve, a complex spanning from Skarżysko-Kamienna to Wąchock, containing several hundred former Paleolithic sites [1] [2]. Archaeological evidence from the area includes stone tools and other artifacts from the Stone Age period [2] [3].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:339704", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-004-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/4a59d4e4/Marcinków (przystanek kolejowy) 7.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348205", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348206", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-3000000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400311", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400312", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}]'::jsonb),
