asion by French armies [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116419", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116420", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116421", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116422", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry_Head'' -> ''https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=62517''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148802", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/4c6645cc/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4c6645cc/Berry Head (2021-07-28) 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248269", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248270", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:310439", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/4c6645cc/Berry Head (2021-07-28) 01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/4c6645cc/BerryHead750px.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385743", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385744", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
