 rectangular hafodydd, probably of medieval date, relating to seasonal settlement [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116424", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116425", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:116426", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s003: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237570", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237571", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
