n made steeper by the builders of the fort [1]. The main enclosure, with three banks and ditches to the north, has an area of about 3 hectares [1]. Adjoining is a roughly triangular eastern enclosure with an area of about 1.8 hectares, and an enclosure to the north of this with an area of about 0.7 hectares [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98919", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98920", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s008: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248337", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248338", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385762", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385763", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
