lennium BC and gives a commanding view of the local countryside [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117604", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117605", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117606", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:117607", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s004: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brown_Clee_Hill'' -> ''https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=11447''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150207", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/577f59ce/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/577f59ce/Brown_Clee_Hill.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248725", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:248726", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s008: period_start None -> ''-443800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349022", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349023", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s004: period_start ''-443800'' -> ''-800''"}]'::jsonb),
