that there were four distinct phases in their development [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Old_Oswestry_Hillfort_%28aerial%29.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/58b9666f/Old Oswestry Hillfort.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:311212", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/58b9666f/Old Oswestry Hillfort.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/58b9666f/Old_Oswestry_Hillfort_(aerial).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
