 in 1994, many bones were collected, with over 80 adult males and females believed to have been buried there [1]. Various objects were also found such as flint arrowheads, smooth and decorated bell-shaped ceramics, dishes, cylindrical idols, and objects of adornment [1]. The evaluation of items found suggested a probable initial use of the dolmen as being in the last centuries of the 4th millennium BCE, with an intensification in its use between 3000 and 2600 BCE [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100051", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100052", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238522", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238523", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325241", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5f9bc540/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5f9bc540/AntadeCarcavelos1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345690", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:345691", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-09a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400359", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400360", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}]'::jsonb),
