tional Archaeological Museum of Athens [1]. Because of its use for the veneration of Pan the cave is also called the Cave of Pan [1]. It was one of the five caves of Pan in the vicinity of ancient Athens [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101668", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101669", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152925", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Votive_relief_from_Mount_Parnes_NAMA_1448.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/722bf4c1/Votive_relief_from_Mount_Parnes_NAMA_1859.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249711", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249712", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334529", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/722bf4c1/Votive_relief_from_Mount_Parnes_NAMA_1859.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/722bf4c1/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349932", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400405", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400406", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-peri