ructed during the period of Romanization of the later-Portuguese territory [1]. The milestones were essential to the consolidation of the new territorial administration imposed by Rome and the routes served inherent military purposes, while assuring the transport of raw materials essential to the good performance of the new imperial order [1]. Examples of the Roman milestones are housed in the installations of the Museum D. Diogo de Sousa [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101679", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101680", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101681", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: site_type ''Inscription'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:152931", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/Geira_Milha_XXIX_detalhe.jpg'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238666", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238667", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-41''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238668", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: site_type None -> ''Monument''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:312298", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-007: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/725d79b1/Geira_Milha_XXIX_detalhe.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349935", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349936", 