ally taken as an indication of clearance in advance of arable farming, but the Crawley Edge field unusually includes a barrow cremation mound among the cairns [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101686", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101687", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249723", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:249724", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349939", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349940", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385862", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385863", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-2500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400411", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400412", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
