end is a cairn circle with a diameter of 12.6 metres [1]. The central cairn is 9.5 metres in diameter and has a height of 0.4 metres [1]. A standing stone terminates the stone row at the northern end [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101780", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:101781", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153129", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-016: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/Ringmoor_Down_Circle.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7793574e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250117", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250118", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349976", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:349977", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385884", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385885", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start ''-2500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400435", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400436", "url": "remediation_change_log", "qu