mmediately outside this center are several mound groups, including one characterized by a pyramid 35 meters in height [1]. Although the general scale of construction at Zapote Bobal is quite large and would normally be characteristic of a long-lived ancient Maya center, it is clear that the city center was occupied for a brief period of time [1]. The royal dynasty at Zapote Bobal seems to have flourished for only 200 years, disintegrating by A.D. 800 [1]. For the majority of the Late Classic (AD 600-900), Zapote Bobal was the center of a kingdom that included the sites of Pajaral and (probably) La Joyanca [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102514", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102515", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102516", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153883", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/Estela_12.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/7d24037c/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:239589", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s006: site_type None -> ''City''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250173", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''500 - 1000 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250174", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350014", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 - 1000 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350015", "url":