rent periods [1]. Around its perimeter is a slope with visible vestiges of low walls [1]. These defensive structures have distinct plans corresponding to different phases at the site [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102544", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102545", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250183", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250184", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:340799", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "insert-2026-10-07-005-001: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ee94c43/Castelo Velho de Freixo de Numão - Portugal (50801841192).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350018", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350019", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355903", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400471", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400472", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}]'::jsonb),
