de network along the Volturno River, linking the area with the rest of eastern Campagnia and the coast of the Tyrrhenian Sea, as well as to the northern areas, including the Pentri settlements of Bovianum and Saepinum [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102546", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:153949", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-017: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/7ef03e67/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250185", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250186", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s011: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350020", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350021", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
