fifteen Palaeolithic artifacts were discovered inside the cave [1]. However, Hadži Prodanova and the nearby Šalitrena Cave are so far the only cave sites in the Central Balkan mountains, that have produced evidence for human presence in a Gravettian and/or Epigravettian cultural context [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102642", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:102643", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s012: period_start ''-50000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:154569", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-018: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/833d2de9/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/833d2de9/Crkva Arhangela Gavrila kraj Hadži Prodanove pećine u Lisi, Ivanjica 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302156", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302157", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-3000000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386523", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386524", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-3000000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400489", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:400490", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s002: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}]'::jsonb),
