antheon\" and date from 704 BC to 681 BC [1]. As with the reliefs at Khinnis, the reliefs at Halamata Cave are \"associated with the northern canal system built by the Assyrian king Sennacherib (r. 704-681 BCE) to carry water to his capital city of Nineveh\" [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:154608", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-018: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/84894867/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/84894867/Maltai_Reliefs_-_Halamata_Cave.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('84c1ff70-a242-423d-96f8-694b1b7fcc67'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '4', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:84c1ff70-a242-423d-96f8-694b1b7fcc67:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''4'' restored on Gazma Cave', '1e275295498d76f17d216a0b8276862b', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Cave Structures'', ''Undated'') is shared by 33 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35103", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0041:chunk-0001: description ''A Middle Paleolithic dwelling site in the Nakhchivan Autonomous Republic of Azerbaijan, discovered in 1983 during an expedition led by M.M. Huseynov and A.G. Jafarov. Located 3km northeast of Tananam village at 1,450m elevation. Layers IV-VI date to approximately 55,000-40,000 years ago. Excavations (1987-1990 by Jafarov, 2008-2013 by Zeynalov) yielded 874 stone tools including 780 obsidians and 93 flints, dominated by Levallois and Mousterian points. Over 17,000 fauna fossils of 24 species were recovered. Palynological analysis shows inhabitants lived in oak and juniper woodlands of an arid zone.'' -> ''Gazma Cave is a Paleolithic dwelling site discovered between Ordubad and Sharur districts in 1983 [1]. Gazma Cave is located 3 km northeast of Tananam village, 1450 m above the sea level [1]. Archeological excavations were carried out there under the leadership of A.G.Jafarov in 1987–1990, and A.Zeynalov in 2008–2013 [1]. In addition to fauna fossils, 874 stone tools were also discovered in the cave [1]. The form of the tools is similar to those derived from Azokh and Tağlar caves [1]. 6 cultural layers were discovered in the cave [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120227", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120228", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120229", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: site_type ''Cave Structures'' -> ''Cave''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250603", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s012: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250604", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s012: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:313191", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/84c1ff70/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/84c1ff70/Dəvəgözündən_əmək_alətləri,_Qazma_mağarası.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350055", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350056", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s005: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355907", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Cave'' -> ''Cave Structures''"}]'::jsonb),
