 were conducted in 1995 and 1997 [1]. Significant pottery finds and other artifacts have been recovered at the site, which is posited to be a satellite site of Xunantunich [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120304", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120305", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-200'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120306", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaa_Creek'' -> ''https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=18170''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:155284", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-019: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/89bdbe2c/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304121", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04e_period-label-undated: period_name None -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:355911", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-24_mechanical-site-type-merge-s002: site_type ''Settlement'' -> ''City/town/settlement''"}]'::jsonb),
