ded during the early Iron Age [1]. Excavation has revealed that the Iron Age inhabitants caught fish and wild boar as well as herding cattle and sheep [1]. There is also evidence of barley and wheat cultivation [1]. The fort appears to have been abandoned by the late Iron Age, the next occupants being Romans [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:120307", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s006: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:155295", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-019: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Round_Hill%2C_Wittenham_Clumps.JPG'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/89dd0394/Round_Hill,_Wittenham_Clumps.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
