ble from Castle Knowe to the south-west [1]. The hill has steep slopes to the west and north, less steep to the east and south [1]. The fort on the summit measures about 75 metres west to east and 60 metres north to south; there are three roughly concentric ramparts on the slopes of the hill, of which the outer rampart and middle ramparts merge on the west side [1]. The fort''s outer rampart is the most substantial [1]. There is an original entrance on the east side, where the rampart''s ends are slightly inturned [1]. There are remains of seven or more roundhouses within the fort, of diameter 3.8 to 8.4 metres; there is some overlapping, indicating that there was more than one phase of occupation [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103413", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:103414", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s013: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250677", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s012: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:250678", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s012: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386553", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386554", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401117", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401118", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::j