 that was somewhat smaller than the 7.6-metre diameter of the cairn [1]. Nothing was found helpful for dating purposes and there were no signs of burial within the circle or the cairn [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104199", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104200", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251097", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251098", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350910", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350911", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386581", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386582", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-2500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401145", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401146", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
