h was recorded by Julio Porres [1]. They were rediscovered in 1918 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104286", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104287", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104288", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: site_type ''Reservoir/aqueduct/canal'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240683", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:240684", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s007: period_start None -> ''1''"}]'::jsonb),
