led stone is mentioned in historical records in Cornwall in 1649, and is referred to as the \"Main-toll great stone\" [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156767", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/The_Tolvan_Holed_Stone_-_geograph.org.uk_-_879659.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9a4ccc75/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251147", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251148", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s013: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386607", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386608", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401165", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401166", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}]'::jsonb),
