averns [1]. Further investigation revealed 19 more caverns nearby [1]. The caves are very large for human-made excavations: The average floor area of each cave is over 1,000 m2, with ceiling heights of up to 30 m, and the total area covered in excess of 30,000 m2 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104301", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104302", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156774", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-021: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9aab078b/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9aab078b/Longyou Xiaonanhai Shishi 2016.12.11 16-07-21.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251471", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251472", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:332736", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-006-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9aab078b/Longyou Xiaonanhai Shishi 2016.12.11 16-07-21.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9aab078b/Longyou Xiaonanhai Shishi 2016.12.11 16-10-51.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350944", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350945", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
