rth, towards the Limes frontline [1]. A wooden construction of unknown function, covering around 45 square meters was found inside [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105053", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105054", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251521", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251522", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334648", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/9fe64aa7/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/9fe64aa7/Kleinkastell_am_Forsthofweg_3.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350985", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:350986", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401183", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401184", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''1''"}]'::jsonb),
