 including three series of ramparts and other walls and some foundations, mostly date to the Middle Ages [1]. Excavations in 1910 and 1954–56 revealed several periods of habitation at the site [1]. According to legend, when Vortigern fled into Wales to escape the Anglo-Saxon invaders, he chose this lofty hillfort as the site for his royal retreat [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105116", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105117", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:157682", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-022: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a38ebb14/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a38ebb14/Castell Dinas Emrys, Parc Cenedlaethol Eryri, Gwynedd, Cymru (Wales) 09.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251549", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251550", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s014: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351001", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:351002", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s006: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401189", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401190", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
