ea within the site encompasses nearly 24 acres (9.7 ha), and the greatest height of the ramparts is about 40 feet (12 m) [1]. The hill has a summit of 193m AOD and overlooks the valley of the River Nadder to the north [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105191", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:105192", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s015: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251907", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251908", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:315628", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-011: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/a847144c/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/a847144c/Castle ditches geograph-390993-by-Toby.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386645", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386646", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401207", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401208", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
