the south lies the River Dever [1]. The site lies just off to the western side of a shallow hill, at a level of approximately 100m AOD [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106009", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106010", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s016: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159137", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-024: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Hunton_Down_Lane_and_Norsebury_Ring_-_geograph.org.uk_-_153005.jpg'' -> ''https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Norsebury_Ring_Hillfort_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5617527.jpg/1280px-Norsebury_Ring_Hillfort_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5617527.jpg''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251979", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:251980", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s015: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:334705", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-002: thumbnail_url ''https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Norsebury_Ring_Hillfort_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5617527.jpg/1280px-Norsebury_Ring_Hillfort_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5617527.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/afa52222/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386667", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:386668", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401227", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-pe