0 cm thick [1]. They are situated about 3 m apart on an open grassy place above Porth Dafarch between two low hills [1]. They are aligned along their long axes in a northeasterly/southwesterly direction [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159996", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-025: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9c/Penrhos_Feilw_-_geograph.org.uk_-_216.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b69f338c/Penrhos Feilw Standing Stones facing away from the road.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
