ter bank and ditch which runs through the hill-fort from south-west to north-east, and is probably part of an extensive surrounding Celtic field system [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106832", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:106833", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s017: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:159997", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-025: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b6aab229/hero.webp'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252397", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252398", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s016: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:324525", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-004-003: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/b6aab229/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:325993", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/b6aab229/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/b6aab229/Grovely Castle - panoramio.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387301", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387302", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401253", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401254", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical