scholars such as Henry de Lumley conducted scientific research in Buzeyir cave in September-October 2002 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107893", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107894", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-70000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252831", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:252832", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s017: period_start None -> ''-3000000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387338", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387339", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-3000000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401281", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401282", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}]'::jsonb),
