nt-day Belgrade) [1]. During the Roman administration, a larger fortress was built with the name Cusum and was included into Roman Pannonia [1]. Subsequently, the fortress was included into the Pannonia Inferior and the Pannonia Secunda [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107955", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107956", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161418", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Petrovaradin_panorama.jpg/400px-Petrovaradin_panorama.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c3517388/Petrovaradin_Fortress_(Péterváradi_vár,_Peterwardein).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242752", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242753", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352753", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352754", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}]'::jsonb),
