", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107994", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161470", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c50a5a61/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c50a5a61/Maen Llia (27181951346).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242769", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242770", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316747", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c50a5a61/Maen Llia (27181951346).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c50a5a61/Menhir_Brecon_Beacon_02.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
