 moats [1]. The innermost walls enclose a 30m by 20m area that contains a single circular house and its only entrance faces West [1]. Ruins of approximately 74 houses have been found [1]. Most of them have circular foundations or elliptical, and few are rectangular [1]. The findings of the Citânia de Santa Luzia include multiple ceramics of the Castro, Roman, and Visigothic eras [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107995", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:107996", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s018: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:161471", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-027: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c548194d/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c548194d/Citânia de Santa Luzia - Viana do Castelo - Portugal (5051353293).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242774", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:242775", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s009: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316750", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c548194d/Citânia de Santa Luzia - Viana do Castelo - Portugal (5051353293).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c548194d/Citânia_de_Santa_Luzia_-_Viana_do_Castelo_-_Portugal_(6649483995).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
