he Roman fort of CICVCIVM at Y Gaer, Brecon and Gobannium at Abergavenny runs along the ridge and is followed by a modern-day bridleway [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124208", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124209", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124210", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''Fortress/citadel'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124211", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Allt_yr_Esgair'' -> ''https://coflein.gov.uk/en/sites/92158''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253213", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253214", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387372", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387373", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401305", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401306", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s003: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
