[1]. The site then underwent a full excavation in 1852 by local historian Beriah Botfield who recorded his findings [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124288", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124290", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''Barrow'' -> ''Fort''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124291", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borough_Hill'' -> ''https://her.northamptonshire.gov.uk/Monument/MNN3603''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162267", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-028: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/ccf25f6a/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ccf25f6a/Borough Hill 18 - panoramio.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253255", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253256", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352813", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352814", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
