m the Conqueror was the village of Scheltone, now known as Earl Shilton [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108807", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108808", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162827", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-029: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/cdd96b01/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/cdd96b01/View towards Earl Shilton - geograph.org.uk - 678046.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253263", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253264", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352819", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:352820", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s008: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
