 [1]. Carrington found a burial chamber built from limestone orthostats with a paved floor [1]. The bones of thirteen individuals were recovered as well as three leaf-shaped flint arrowheads [1]. The smaller southern cairn is 15 metres across and survives to 1.2 metres in height following extensive modern damage [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108856", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108857", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253623", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253624", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s019: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387400", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387401", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401859", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401860", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}]'::jsonb),
