marks [1]. Within the circle there are traces of a low mound [1]. This is thought to be the remains of a stone cairn which predates the construction of the stone circle and may have been the site of Bronze-Age burials [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109762", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109763", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163839", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/The_Goatstones_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1138462.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/db61f285/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254111", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254112", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353718", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353719", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-4000'' -> ''-2500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387418", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387419", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-2500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401889", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:40189