 sharpen his scythe, and left the rock on the site in a gesture of anger [1]. The monument was listed as a monument historique in 1889 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109797", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109798", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164323", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/Verziau_de_Gargantua%2C_Bois-l%C3%A8s-Pargny.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dce4d9db/Verziau de Gargantua 2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254127", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254128", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318424", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/dce4d9db/Verziau de Gargantua 2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dce4d9db/Verziau_de_Gargantua,_Bois-lès-Pargny.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353733", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353734", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354795", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354796", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-19r_fields-wd5-s001: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:3874