numerous artefacts that now comprise one of the finest collections ... of Prehistoric antiquities in England\" [1]. The finds included iron weapons and tools, bronze brooches, pottery, glass and around 159 quern-stones [1]. All were given to the town\\''s museum [1]. Hunsbury Hill fort is a designated Scheduled Monument [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110490", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110491", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164383", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/dfab4856/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/dfab4856/Hunsbury_Hill_Digital_Terrain_Model.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243818", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243819", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-700''"}]'::jsonb),
