 Age [1]. The stone circle had a slightly ovoid plan, with a maximum diameter of 79 metres, and followed the same axis as the henge itself [1]. It originally featured 36 stones, most of which were removed by the end of the Medieval period [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110513", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110514", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254157", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254158", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387438", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387439", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401905", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401906", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
