021: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110560", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164527", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e35c15c4/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e35c15c4/Elworthy_Barrows_Digital_Terrain_Model.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254183", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254184", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387444", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387445", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401909", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401910", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('e364d6eb-f92a-44d7-80b2-025092a81561'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '2', 'card-stats-2026-11-07c-rollback:e364d6eb-f92a-44d7-80b2-025092a81561:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07c: mystery ''2'' restored on Multan Fort', 'fed1d9cfeed02faff5bdb5017504bd04', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Fortress/citadel'', ''Undated'') is shared by 27 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export 80b2b77ea294dfe0 (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 766 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07''s own export (2026-11-07 10:00:39.847916+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:42264", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0064:chunk-0001: description ''Multan Fort was a historic fortress in present-day Multan, Pakistan. According to some estimates, the original fort was constructed by the Katoch Rajput Dynasty between 800 and 1000 BC, making it one of the oldest forts in the region [1]. The fort was later destroyed but rebuilt by Ranghar chiefs on a hillock separated from the city by the Ravi River [1]. In 1849, during British colonial rule, the fort was destroyed by British forces [1].'' -> ''The Multan Fort was a historic fort in the city of Multan, Punjab, Pakistan [1]. It was built on a hillock separated from the city by the Ravi River [1]. The fort was destroyed in 1849 by British forces during the Second Anglo-Sikh War [1]. The walls of the fort were built by the Mughal prince Murad Bakhsh in the 17th century [1]. The famed Multan Sun Temple was located within the fort premises [1]. Contemporary reports put the walls of the fort at 40 to 70 feet high and 6,800 feet in circumference [1]. The fort had 46 bastions which included two flanking towers at each of the four gates [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110561", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110562", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:164528", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-031: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/Rukn-e-Alam_Tomb_Multan_1865.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e364d6eb/Bab-e-Qasim Multan 2005-12-04 by Ibneazhar.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254185", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254186", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318546", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e364d6eb/Bab-e-Qasim Multan 2005-12-04 by Ibneazhar.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e364d6eb/Rukn-e-Alam_Tomb_Multan_1865.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353767", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353768", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
