 of occupation by Upper Paleolithic anatomically modern humans has also been found at Spy [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110571", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110572", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-35000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165018", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/Spygrot.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e3e42f8a/Spy Cave - 11.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254191", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254192", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318550", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e3e42f8a/Spy Cave - 11.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e3e42f8a/Spygrot.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353771", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353772", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
