sented, but easily traced, due to the vegetation [1]. A fourth, outermost wall is discerned on aerial photographs [1]. Without datable artifacts, the hillfort is nonetheless assigned to the Iron Age of pre-Roman Britain on the basis of its general form [1]. Because the enclosed area is less than 1 ha, it would be classified as a \"small multivallate hillfort\" [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110582", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110583", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165037", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url None -> ''/data/images/wiki/e500a4eb/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254199", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254200", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s020: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387450", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387451", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401915", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401916", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
