as built by Archedemus of Thera [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165080", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Nympholept.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e6a32ed2/Vari Cave sections (AJA 7 1930 pl II).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:319202", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-015: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e6a32ed2/Vari Cave sections (AJA 7 1930 pl II).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e6a32ed2/Nympholept.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
