56 metres [1]. There are steep natural slopes on three sides of the fort, and linear ramparts across the flat southern approaches [1]. Lamberts Castle was built around 2,500 years ago; a prominent ditch and bank still survive near the western entrance [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110680", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:110681", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s021: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165230", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-032: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e9a63a95/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e9a63a95/Lamberts_Castle_Digital_Terrain_Model.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254601", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254602", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:335289", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-009-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/e9a63a95/Lamberts_Castle_Digital_Terrain_Model.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/e9a63a95/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387464", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387465", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401933", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401934", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-peri