 Naranjo describing the burning of a rebellious vassal city named Bahlam Jol dated to 21 May 697 CE [1]. This event caused a significant decline in the population of the city, with many of its inhabitants likely enslaved or taken prisoner by Naranjo [1]. The city was rebuilt during the early 700s CE, though less prominent and more sparsely populated than before [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111359", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254613", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254614", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353819", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353820", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401937", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401938", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}]'::jsonb),
