r condition [1]. Anta da Valeira 1 is situated between two olive trees [1]. Six large stones or pillars can be seen but all have fallen from their original positions [1]. Anta da Valeira 2 is also in a bad condition [1]. Five large stones that would have served as pillars remain on the site, which has been much affected by agricultural work [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111367", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111368", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165744", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/eb736314/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/eb736314/AntadaValeira2.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254619", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:254620", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s021: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326404", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/eb736314/AntadaValeira2.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/eb736314/AntadaValeira1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387466", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387467", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401939", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401940", "url": "r