gular, one-chambered dolmen is about 2.75 meters long and 2 meters wide, its long axis is oriented towards the south-east [1]. The dolmen was a burial tomb of a local chieftain [1]. Analyses showed that the defunct was not incinerated [1]. Peyre-Brune is one of the very few megalithic monuments in this region, that can be attributed to a local culture [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112213", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112214", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166590", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/DolmenPeyrebrune.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f56eb08e/Saint-Aquilin dolmen (2).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255031", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255032", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:326490", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f56eb08e/Saint-Aquilin dolmen (2).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f56eb08e/DolmenPeyrebrune.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387492", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387493", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401969", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 45