at this site include bronze tools, both animal and human bones, pottery and stone tools [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112265", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112266", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112267", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: site_type ''Necropolis/tombs complex'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:166760", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-034: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/Burial_4_Nyaung%27gan.jpg'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/f96b9c6e/Burial_4_Nyaung''gan.webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:244842", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s011: site_type None -> ''Cemetery''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255055", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255056", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354438", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: lat ''21.613916605662713'' -> ''22.4''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354439", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: lon ''95.40172617853912'' -> ''95.066667''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387761", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387762", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401979", "u