excavation started only in 1996 [1]. The Red Lady was discovered in 2010 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112343", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112344", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-17000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167405", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/fce614a8/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fce614a8/Cueva de El Mirón 1.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302218", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302219", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-300000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354476", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:354477", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s010: period_start ''-300000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401987", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401988", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-4501''"}]'::jsonb),
