ted as a scheduled monument [1]. The site is at grid reference SU381353, east of the village of Stockbridge [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:112358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s023: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167445", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Woolbury_Ring%2C_Stockbridge_Down_-_geograph.org.uk_-_100453.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fd7b2e9e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255099", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255100", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387771", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387772", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401989", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401990", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
