 is difficult, pottery excavated in 1956 indicates that the mound (and therefore probably the stones also) are Neolithic [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126712", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126713", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:126714", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s011: site_type ''Megalithic stones'' -> ''Standing stone''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:167466", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-035: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/The_Longstone%2C_Mottistone%2C_IW%2C_UK.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fe268a4c/The longstone, Mottistone, Isle of Wight, England (2).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255101", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:255102", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s022: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:327195", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-005-004: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/fe268a4c/The longstone, Mottistone, Isle of Wight, England (2).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/fe268a4c/The Longstone, Mottistone, IW, UK.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387773", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387774", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s005: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401991", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s